            "accordion_title_1": "Safety Notes",
            "accordion_intro_1": "",
            "accordion_list_style_1": "bullet",
            "accordion_item_1_1": "Do not use on broken or irritated skin.",
            "accordion_item_1_2": "Do not look directly into the LEDs while in use.",
            "accordion_item_1_3": "Not recommended for use if you are pregnant, have epilepsy, or other photosensitive conditions—consult your physician.",
            "accordion_item_1_4": "Only use the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System as directed.",
            "accordion_title_2": "Light Sensitivity Test",
            "accordion_intro_2": "Follow these steps before your first use to check if you are light-sensitive:",
            "accordion_list_style_2": "number",
            "accordion_item_2_1": "Remove the power supply from the product (see instructions).",
            "accordion_item_2_2": "Apply the product to your inner forearm, ensuring the light shines directly onto the skin. Use it for a 10-minute treatment.",
            "accordion_item_2_3": "Wait for 24 hours. If you experience pain, discomfort, or redness lasting more than 2 hours, you might be light-sensitive. Please consult a doctor for advice before continuing use.",
