        "step3_jTLxNk": {
          "type": "step3",
          "settings": {
            "title": " How to Use",
            "accordion_title_1": "Clean the Skin",
            "accordion_image_1": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/clean_skin_icon_f2afb7f9-b631-4273-8249-fc3b7f9fb7ad.svg",
            "accordion_content_1": "Make sure the skin you want to treat is clean, dry, and free of makeup or other topicals.",
            "accordion_title_2": "Connect the Product to the Controller",
            "accordion_content_2": "<p>Insert the USB-C cable from the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System into the port located on the top of the controller.<\/p><p>Note:<\/p><p>The Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System can be worn in two ways:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Secured around the neck <\/strong>– to comfortably treat the entire neck and décolletage area.<\/li><li><strong>Strap positioned across the shoulders <\/strong>– to lower the LED panel slightly and extend coverage further across the décolletage.<\/li><\/ul><p>Both positions deliver full treatment benefits—just choose the fit that best suits your comfort and desired coverage.<\/p>",
            "accordion_title_3": "Turn It On",
            "desktop_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/connect_icon_e7c23427-2fe5-426e-984a-f437711ec64c.svg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/turn_it_on_mob.webp",
            "accordion_content_3": "<p>Press the ON\/OFF button on the controller. The treatment will automatically run for 10 minutes and shut off at the end of the session.<\/p><p>(You can also stop the treatment anytime by pressing the ON\/OFF button again.)<\/p>",
            "accordion_title": "Clean After Use",
            "accordion_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/clean_icon_0df602ec-9232-4379-9c29-1b562dd254ba.svg",
            "accordion_text": "<p>After each use, clean the product using a water-based wipe, a damp cloth, or by spraying Qure Dermal Mist directly onto the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System. Allow it to air dry fully. Do not clean while connected to power.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "step4_JLUdyp": {
          "type": "step4",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Treatment Routine",
            "frequency_heading": "Frequency",
            "frequency_paragraph_1": "Use the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System once per day for a minimum of 4 weeks.",
            "frequency_paragraph_2": "After that, continue based on your personal care routine.",
            "limit_heading": "Limit",
            "limit_paragraph": "Do not use the product more than 7 times per week."
          }
        },
        "step5_McG6iA": {
          "type": "step5",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Charging Instructions",
            "charging_main_title": "Initial Charge",
            "initial_charge_title": "Initial Charge",
            "initial_charge": "<p>Charge the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System fully for 4 hours before first use.<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "power_supply_title": "Power Supply",
            "power_supply": "<p>Only use a 5V adapter or USB-C power supply.Fast chargers may damage the battery.<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "charging_process_title": "Charging Process",
            "img_5": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/charge_icon_9cc876e6-9723-44d4-aead-52a63745bb57.svg",
            "li_items": "<ul><li>Insert the USB-C cable into the bottom of the controller (look for the ⚡ symbol).<\/li><li>Connect the other end to a USB-C power source.<\/li><li>The LED indicator will flash white while charging, then show a steady white light when fully charged.<\/li><li>Ensure the plug and socket are completely dry before charging.<\/li><li>Unplug the product before use — it will not operate while charging.<\/li><\/ul>"
          }
        },
        "step6_tXAqdG": {
          "type": "step6",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care & Storage",
            "prepare_shower_title": "Preparing Your Shower Head",
            "prepare_shower_content": "<p>To extend battery life, allow it to fully charge and fully discharge during regular use.<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "storage_title": "Storage",
            "storage_content": "<ul><li>Keep the Qure™ Neck & Décolletage LED System at room temperature in dry conditions.<\/li><li>Store it in the provided storage pouch to avoid bending or crushing.<\/li><li>Avoid dusty, sunny, humid, or damp environments.<\/li><\/ul>"
          }
        },
        "step7_jJiVEV": {
          "type": "step7",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Troubleshooting",
            "product_doesnt_switch_on_title": "Product doesn’t switch on?",
            "product_doesnt_switch_on_content": "<ul><li>Ensure the product is fully charged.<\/li><li>Make sure the charging cable is properly inserted into the power outlet.<\/li><li>Check that the charging cable is fully inserted into the product.<\/li><li>Try a different power outlet — the one used may not have worked during charging.<\/li><li>Ensure the USB-C cable is plugged into the correct port on the controller (look for the port marked with the lightning bolt battery symbol).<\/li><li>Press and hold the ON\/OFF button for a full second to activate the product.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "product_doesnt_switch_off_title": "Product switches off unexpectedly?",
            "product_doesnt_switch_off_content": "<p>The battery level may be too low — charge the product fully and try again.<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
