            "still_not_working_content": "<ul><li>DO NOT attempt to investigate or modify the product. It contains no serviceable parts.<\/li><li>If the issue persists, please contact Qure Support at <a href=\"mail:support@qureskincare.com\">support@qureskincare.com <\/a>for further assistance.<\/li><\/ul>"
